  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the governance and central coordination of the UN Decade o</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOC-UNESCO was mandated to lead the preparatory phase of the Decade, in consultation will all stakeholders. 
Starting in January 2021, the Decade&apos;s implementation will be supported by a governance and coordination structure that ensures strategic and operational coherence, while allowing for agility and flexibility. This structure aims to create the enabling conditions to foster and support multi-sector engagement throughout the Decade. 

This project will support priority activities needed for the establishment and operation of the governance and coordination structures for the Decade.</narrative>
  </description>
